          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On January 24, 2008, at 1:15 a.m., a witness observed at high altitude a white light that drew two circles in the clear sky before disappearing. During the observation, a loud rumbling noise was heard. The witness's description clearly suggests an airplane. However, the movement of the light point is surprising. The witness was, however, on the edge of a military air training zone (see attached map, taken from the \"Very Low Altitude Defense Network Map\" RTBA): a military airplane could very well exhibit this behavior during a maneuver. This case is classified as \"B\": probable observation of a military airplane in maneuver.",
